  tutorialClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc8c829377bd4f6419d7f495caa4594d, type: 3}
  subtitleList:
  - "Alright, now that we\u2019re flying steady\u2014let\u2019s talk fuel."
  - Look over to the left side of the cockpit. See that gauge?
  - "That\u2019s not just for show\u2014it\u2019s linked straight to the battery
    level of your BCI thingy."
  - When it's normal, we're good to go.
  - "Yellow? That means power\u2019s running low\u2014might want to land and recharge
    soon."
  - "But if it hits red... buckle up. The device could shut down any moment, and
    we\u2019ll be flying blind."
  - Keep one eye on that gauge, cadet. A sharp pilot always knows their limits.
